<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Waebulaniya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibaluwa kwa Waebulaniya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Waebulaniya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Waeb</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibaluwa kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Waebulaniya</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="im">Ibaluwa kwa Waebulaniya tsayandikighwa kuwaghuma ghumoyo Wakiristu. Nayo yolangusa Yesu pfatimilitse unabii wa Laghano lya Ghumwande. Mne ibaluwa ino hana mbuli ka sitini itsili mne Laghano lya Ghumwande itsilangusa ghendo ka Yesu katimitsa unabii na sang'ano tsa Mtambika Mkulu wa Chiyahudi. Kwa chinu acho ibaluwa ino yakoneka yandikighwa ili kuwaghuma ghumoyo Wakiristu wa Chiyahudi. Yesu iyo nambiko ya nzambi tsose, mala lumwe na kwa matsuwa ghose. Wakiristu wa matsuwa ghano nawo pfipfila wodaha kughumighwa ghumoyo na ibaluwa ino waghendelele kumuwinza Yesu Kiristu iyotutenda tudahe kumtoghola Imulungu, na kughendelela kumtoghola yeye imwenyegho (12:2).</para>
  <para style="ip">Haduhu imunu iyomanya ibaluwa ino tsayandikighwe na nani, lekeni iwasomi wolonga kodaha kuwa mtumighwa Pauli au Luka au Balinaba. Kuya haduhu imunu iyomanya yandikighwe tsuwachi, ila iwanu wengi wakona yandikighwa mne miyaka ya sabini kulawa Yesu helekighwe. Yerusalemu tsaihinyighwa mne ghumwaka sabini kulawa Yesu helekighwe, lekeni imunu yandike ibaluwa ino kolonga mbuli tsa Yerusalemu ka ng'ana ihinyighwe. Ibaluwa ino tsayandikighwa mne ghumji ghwa Roma (13:24) na lamda tsaibita mne makanisa mengi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mghati</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 1:1-4:13 Imunu andike ibaluwa ino kolangusa ukulu wa Yesu kwa manabii we Imulungu na kwa wamalaika</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 4:14-7:28 Kolangusa ka Yesu Kiristu ka mkulu kubita iwatambika iwasang'ane mne ing'anda ye Imulungu akula Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 8:1-10:31 Kuya kolangusa sang'ano ya Yesu ng'ulu kubita laghano lya ghumwande lyayalaghane Imulungu ne iwanu wake kubitila malaghitso ghamwing'ile Musa.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 10:32-13:17 Hamalitse kulangusa ukulu wa Yesu kwa chila chinu, kolapfa malangulitso mengi.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 13:18-25 Komalitsila ibaluwa yake kwa kuwaghuma iwanu ghumoyo na kuwalamsa iwanu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye Imulungu kubitila Imwanaghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Aho ghumwande Imulungu tsakalonga na aba tsetu mala nyingi na kwa nzila nyingi kubitila manabii wake, <verse number="2" style="v"/>lekeni mne ghamatsuwa ghano gha ukutsigha kalonga na twetwe kubitila Imwanaghe, iyamsaghule na yamwing'ile pfinu pfose pfiwe pfake, kuya kubitila yeye Imulungu tsakalumba isi yose. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yeye katumwemwesela utunitso we Imulungu, na keghala ghendo ne Imulungu imwenyegho pfayali. Kaikindilisa isi yose ighendelele kuwa baho kwa mbuli yake ine ingupfu. Hamalitse sang'ano ya kuwatenda iwanu wele kulawa mne nzambi tsawo, kakala kulanga ubali wa ghumoko ghwe kujilo ghwe Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Imwana we Imulungu mkulu kubita wamalaika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Imwana katendighwa mkulu kubita wamalaika, ka taghwa lyeng'ighwe ne Imulungu pfalili kulu kubita taghwa lyawo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mana Imulungu ng'amlongele ghendo malaika wowose,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ghweghwe kwa Imwanangu</para>
  <para style="q">leloli nolonga nene niwa Aba wako.”</para>
  <para style="m">Wala ng'alongile ghendo kwa malaika.</para>
  <para style="q">“Nitsakuwa Aba wake,</para>
  <para style="q">naye katsakuwa Mwanangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lekeni Imulungu hayomghala chaudele wake muisi, kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Wamalaika wose we Imulungu wamtamanile”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lekeni kuna wamalaika Imulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Imulungu kawatenda libeho</para>
  <para style="q">wamalaika wake</para>
  <para style="q">na iwatumwa wake kawatenda kuwa imilambi ye ghumoto.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni kwa imwana, Imulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Undewa wako, ghwe Imulungu, ng'aumala bae.</para>
  <para style="q">Ghweghwe kwotawala kwa kumnoghelesa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ghweghwe konoghela ghamatendo ighomnoghela Imulungu na koghahila ghehile.</para>
  <para style="q">Apfo Imulungu, Imulungu wako kakusaghula,</para>
  <para style="q">kakutenda udeng'elele ng'ani</para>
  <para style="q">kubita pfawatendile weyagho.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kuya kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ghweghwe Imtwatsa aho mwanduso tsakulumba isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q">kwa ghamoko ghako tsakulumba kulanga.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Napfo pfitsohupa, ila ghweghwe kutsosighala,</para>
  <para style="q">pfose pfitsolala ka lighwanda.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kutsotsibotabota ka gholole,</para>
  <para style="q">natso tsitsoghaluka,</para>
  <para style="q">lekeni ghweghwe kutsosighala pfipfo pfauli</para>
  <para style="q">na ughima wako ng'autsomala bae.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Imulungu ng'amlongele mbe malaika wowose,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ukale hano ubali wangu wa kujilo</para>
  <para style="q">mbaka hanitsoweka wehile wako</para>
  <para style="q">hasi ha ghamaghulu ghako.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lelo kuya wamalaika tsina nani? Wawo muhe iwomsang'anila Imulungu, na waghalighwa nae kuwapfila awala iwatsobokela ukombotsi.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ukombotsi mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lelo tughakinde ghendo aghala ighatuhulike ili tuleke kuleka kupfika kwatughenda. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Usenga ula iulongighwe ne wamalaika woneka wolongesa ghendo, imunu wowose yang'aukindile au kuutoghola kohighighwa ka pfaibamighwa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lelo twetwe tutsohonatse ka ng'atuutoghola bae ukombotsi uno mkulu? Tanu Imtwatsa tsakalonga ukombotsi uno, kuya awala iwamuhulike walangusa kuna twetwe ka wolongesa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Imulungu naye kongetsa ukalangama wake kwa kutenda pfitango, pfihulo na pfinzonza ketseketse, na kwa kuwagholela iwanu pfigholelo pfa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka ka pfayabamile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iyo iyotulongotsa mne ukombotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Imulungu ng'awekile bae malaika kutawala isi iikutsa, isi ila yatulonga mbuli tsake. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lekeni Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka hanu hangi gholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Imunu chinu chachi mbaka umwalangule?</para>
  <para style="q">Imwana we imunu chinu chachi mbaka umlolese?</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Tsakumtenda yawe mdodo kubita wamalaika,</para>
  <para style="q">kumpfika fiya ya utunitso na heshima.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwika chila chinu chiwe hasi hake.”</para>
  <para style="m">Yolongighwa Imulungu tsakamwika imunu yawe mtawala we pfinu pfose, ng'achisighala hata chinu chimwe bae. Lekeni ng'atukona ipfinu pfose imunu pfopfitawala sambi, <verse number="9" style="v"/>ila twomwona Yesu iyatendighwe mdodo kubita wamalaika kwa chipindi chidodo, ili kwa uluso we Imulungu yawafile iwanu wose. Sambi twomwona kapfatsighwa fiya ya utunitso na heshima kwa ukufa kwayadununzike. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tsaikala pfinogha ghendo Imulungu iyolumba na ukukindilisa ipfinu pfose, yamtende Yesu kuwa mkamilifu kwa inzila ye ukudununzika, ili yawaghale iwanu wengi mne utunitso wake. Kwaapfila Yesu iyo iyowalongotsa mne ukombotsi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yeye kowadeghetesa iwanu nzambi tsawo, yeye na awala iwadeghetesighwe, wose wana aba yumwe. Kwaajili ayo Yesu ng'akona chinyala bae kuwakema iwanu awo ndughu tsake, <verse number="12" style="v"/>kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Nitsolipeta taghwa lyako kwe iwanu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q">nitsokutunya mne ghumtingano ghwawo.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pfipfila kolonga, “Nitsakwika lolelo lyangu kuna yeye. Kuya kalonga keli, nene nabaha ne iwana iyangaile Imulungu, wawe wana wangu”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lelo kwaapfila iwana awo wana lukuli na idamu, Yesu imwenyegho tsakawa ka wawo, kelunga na unu wawo. Tsakatenda apfo ili kubitila lifwa lyake amuhume Yehile yane uwetso mne lifwa, <verse number="15" style="v"/>na apfo yawalekelele awala iwakalile watumwa mna ughima wawo wose. Tsawakala watumwa kwa kupfuka ukufa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwaapfila yeye ng'atsile ghendo bae kuwapfila wamalaika ila katsa kuwapfila iwatsukulu wa Abrahamu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apfo tsakabamighwa yeghale na ndughu tsake kwa chila chinu, ili yawe Mtambika wawo mkulu iyotogholighwa na yane libatsi mne kumsang'anila Imulungu, ili nzambi tse iwanu tsileghusighwe. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwaapfila yeye mwenyegho tsakadununzika ahala hayaghetsighwe, kodaha kuwapfila awala iwoghetsighwa.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ka mkulu kubita Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Apfo ndughu tsangu iwanu we Imulungu, imkemighwe ne Imulungu, mmwalangule Yesu, Imtumighwa na Mtambika mkulu we inoghola yatuilonga toitoghola. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yeye tsakakala kotogholighwa ne Imulungu, iyamsaghule kutenda isang'ano yake, ka Musa pfayang'ali iyotogholighwa mne ukuwasang'anila iwanu wose wa Isiraeli, iwakemighwe ing'anda ye Imulungu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Imunu iyotsenga ing'anda kotunyighwa kubita ing'anda yenyegho, lelo Yesu kotunyighwa kubita Musa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwaapfila chila ing'anda itsengighwa ne imunu, lekeni Imulungu iyo iyatsengile chila chinu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Musa tsayang'ali yotogholighwa ka mtumwa kwe iwanu wose wa Isiraeli, iwakemighwe ing'anda ye Imulungu, na tsakalonga ipfinu apfila Imulungu pfayatsolonga hambele, <verse number="6" style="v"/>ila Kiristu katogholighwa ka imwana mne ing'anda ye Imulungu. Twetwe iwenyegho twa ing'anda yake ka twoghendelela ukwima bila ukupfuka na kuchilolela achila chatwighodela.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukubwihila kwe iwanu we Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Apfo ka Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka pfayolonga mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka,</para>
  <para style="q">“Leloli mng'ahulika litsi lye Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>mleke kutenda imimoyo yenu iwe misughu,</para>
  <para style="q">ka pfawatendile iwabala wenu hawalemile kunihulikitsa,</para>
  <para style="q">ghamatsuwa ghala hawanighetsile</para>
  <para style="q">akula kunyika.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ako iwabala wenu tsawanighetsa na kunidodosa,</para>
  <para style="q">hata ka tsawaghona ghanendile kwa miyaka makumi mane.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Apfo niwonela maya iwanu wala, nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Ghamatsuwa ghose lweleko lula lwakwagha,</para>
  <para style="q">na ng'alumanya bae nzila tsangu.’</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>‘Tsanilaha kwa maya nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q">ng'awatsakwingila mbe hanu hangu ha kubwihila!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lelo ndughu tsangu, mwalangitse mghati mwenu kuleke kuwa ne imunu yane ghumoyo ghuhile na wa kulema kutoghola, kwa kwibaghula ne Imulungu iyali mghima. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lekeni hamghendela kuhulika mbuli ila leloli yosomighwa mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, mwighume ghumoyo chila litsuwa ili kuleke kuwa ne imunu mghati mwenu iyotendighwa mkomu kwa ukughutsukighwa ne nzambi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwaapfila twakuwa wamwe mna Kiristu, tung'akindilisa kwe ingupfu mbaka utsighilo lolelo lyetu lyatubokele mwanduso.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Leloli mng'ahulika litsi lye Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">mleke kuitenda mimoyo yenu iwe misughu,</para>
  <para style="q">ka pfawatendile iwabala wenu hawamlemile Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuya tsina nani iwahulike litsi lye Imulungu na kumlemela? Pfii si awala wose bae iwalongotsighwe na Musa kulawa Misiri? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Angu tsina nani Imulungu yawonele maya kwa miyaka makumi mane? Kawonela maya awala iwatendile nzambi, ng'uli tsawo tsatsenela kunyika. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Angu Imulungu helahile, “Ng'awatsakwingila mbe hanu hangu ha kubwihila,” yang'ali yowalonga tsina nani? Yang'ali yowalonga awala yang'awamuhulikitse. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lelo twakona ng'awadahile ukwingila ako kwaapfila tsawalema kutoghola.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lelo kwaapfila laghano lye ukwingila hanu hake ling'ali baho, twalangitse imunu wowose mna twetwe aleke kuleka kwingila hanu hao ho ukubwihila. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Imbuli Inoghile tsaipetighwa kuna twetwe ka pfaipetighwe kuna wawo iwanu wa ghumwande. Lekeni usenga awo ng'auwapfile chinu bae, kwaapfila tsawahulika ila ng'awaubokele kwa ukutoghola. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Twetwe itutoghole tutsakwingila hanu ho ukubwihila ka pfayalongile.</para>
  <para style="q">“Tsambona maya na nilaha,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Ng'awatsakwingila mbe hanu hangu ha kubwihila!’ ”</para>
  <para style="m">Imulungu tsakalonga agho hata ka isang'ano yake tsaimala kulawa hayalumbile isi yose. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholonga mbuli tsa litsuwa lya saba, “Imulungu tsakaileka sang'ano yake yose, litsuwa lya saba kabwihila.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kuya chinu chino cholongighwa keli, “Ng'awatsakwingila mbe hanu hangu ha kubwihila.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Apfo laghano lye ukubwihila ling'ali baha, na iwanu wala iwapetelighwe Imbuli Inoghile aho mwanduso tsang'awengile hamo kwaapfila ng'awategheletse bae. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Chinu chino cholangusa kuwa Imulungu keka litsuwa lingi, ilikemighwa “Leloli.” Miyaka mingi ibitile tsakalonga kubitila Daudi ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Leloli mng'ahulika litsi lye Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">mleke kuitenda mimoyo yenu iwe misughu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mana ka Yoshua ang'awatendile iwanu wabwihile, ka pfayalongile Imulungu, Imulungu ang'alekile kulonga mbuli tsa litsuwa lingi hambele. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Apfo kubwihila kwe iwanu we Imulungu kung'ali baho ka Imulungu pfabwihile tsuwa lya saba. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Imunu wowose yakwingila hanu ha kubwihila ka pfayalongile Imulungu, ayo katsoleka sang'ano yake na kubwihila ka Imulungu pfalekile sang'ano yake na kubwihila. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lelo twiyunde twingile mne ukubwihila ako, ili kuleke kulawila imunu wowose mna twetwe aleke ukughwa kwa kulema kutegheletsa ka pfawatendile wawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwaapfila mbuli tse Imulungu tsina ughima na ingupfu, tsotema kubita mmaghe ighutema kuno na kuno. Kuya tsakwingila mbaka hane ghumoyo na muhe, ka limaghe ilitema mbaka mghati mwa pfilungo na ulojo, kuya tsomanya ghaikwalangula na ghaibama mimoyo ye iwanu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuduhu chilumbe chochose ichipfisighwe kwe Imulungu, chila chinu chighubulighwa kuna yeye iyatubamighwa tumlongele ghamatendo ghetu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Mtambika mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Apfo kwaapfila twinaye Mtambika mkulu iyengile mbaka kulanga kwe Imulungu, Yesu Imwana we Imulungu, leka tukindilise ukutoghola kwetu kwatulonga totoghola. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mtambika wetu mkulu kotwonela libatsi, kwaapfila yeye mwenyegho tsakaghetsighwa mna chila chinu ka twetwe, ila ng'atendile nzambi bae. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lelo tuchighendele chighoda che undewa che Imulungu yane uluso bila kupfuka, tubokele libatsi na uluso mne chipindi cho ukutwapfila.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Chila mtambika mkulu kosaghulighwa kulawa kwe iwanu wake, kakwikighwa yawatendele iwanu isang'ano ye Imulungu kwa kumlapfila maghweko na nambiko kwaajili ya nzambi tsawo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwaapfila yeye imwenyegho tsakahungukighwa ghendo, kodaha kuwonela libatsi iwanu awala ing'awomanya chinu na iwakwagha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na kwaapfila yeye imwenyegho kahungukighwa, kobamighwa yelapfile mwenyegho nambiko, si kwaajili ye iwanu wangi waliheka bae, ila pfipfila kwaajili ya nzambi tsake. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu iyetenda imwenyegho kuwa mtambika mkulu. Imulungu iyo iyomkema yawe mtambika mkulu, ka pfakalile Aruni. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kiristu Mkombotsi pfipfila ng'etendile bae imwenyegho yawe Mtambika mkulu. Ila Imulungu kamlongela,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ghweghwe kwa Imwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q">leloli nolonga niwa Aba wako.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pfipfila hanu hangi mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Kutsakuwa mtambika ghamatsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q">ka pfakalile Melikisedeki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mna matsuwa ghake ghakalile muisi, Yesu tsakamlomba na ukumdedetsa na kumlilila ng'ani kwa masotsi Imulungu, iyodaha kumkombola kulawa mne lifwa. Kwaapfila tsakakala mhole na kompfuka Imulungu, Imulungu kamuhulikitsa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hata ka tsakakala Imwana we Imulungu, kelangulitsa ukutegheletsa kubitila ukudununzika kwake. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hayamalitse sang'ano yatumighwe kutenda, kawa mwanduso we ukombotsi wa ghamatsuwa ghose kwa awala iwomuhulikitsa, <verse number="10" style="v"/>na Imulungu kamsaghula yawe mtambika mkulu, ka pfayakalile Melikisedeki.</para>
  <para style="s">Tuleke kuya kuchughu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuya twinagho mengi gha kulonga kwa chinu chino, lekeni pfikomu kughalonga ghoya kwaapfila mwemwe muwa wadebwe ukwilangulitsa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Sambi tsambamighwa muwe walangulitsi, kwaapfila ghamatsuwa mengi ma ghabita, lekeni mwemwe mwobama keli imunu yawalangulitse malangulitso gha mwanduso ghe mbuli tse Imulungu. Sambi muya kuchughu mwobama ukughwawa na si ukuja chijo chikomu bae. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Chila imunu iyoghwawa matombo ng'odaha bae kughatanga ighomnoghela Imulungu, kwaapfila ayo ang'ali mwana mdodo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Chijo chikomu cha iwanu iwabala, wane tsimbutsi itsilangulitsighwe kubaghula ighanoghile na ighehile.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lelo tugheke hambali ghamalangulitso gha mwanduso gha mbuli tsa Kiristu, tughende hambele kwa ghamalangulitso ighakomale. Si kughendelela kwika keli ghumsingi ghwa kuleka ghamatendo ghalihela sang'ano, na ghwa kumtoghola Imulungu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>ghamalangulitso gha ubatitso, ukwikighwa ghamoko, kutsilihuka kwe iwanu na ukuhighighwa kwa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tughendele hambele Imulungu ang'abama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwaapfila iwanu iwaghubulilighwe ukweli we Imulungu na kulanza pfigholelo pfa kulanga, na ukwilunga na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, <verse number="5" style="v"/>na kulanza umta we mbuli tse Imulungu, na ingupfu ye ghamatsuwa ighakutsa, <verse number="6" style="v"/>ng'aidahika bae kuwoyitsa watoghole keli kutsileka nzambi tsawo, kwaapfila kwa kuleka kwawo kutoghola, wawo wenyegho ka womuwamba keli Imwana we Imulungu mna msalaba na kumghela chinyala hambele he iwanu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mghunda ighubokela imvula ighutowela ghamatsuwa ghose na ukotetsa imimeya inoghile kwaajili ye imunu iyolima, ghubalikighwa ne Imulungu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni mghunda ighukotetsa imibiki ye tsimiwa na mighughu, wahela sang'ano, ghwabehi kulighitighwa ne Imulungu, kuya yolakatsighwa mmoto. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni sale tsetu, hata ka twolonga pfino, twomanya ghendo ka mwa mne inzila inoghile imlongotsani mne ukombotsi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Imulungu ng'ohigha pfihile bae. Yeye ng'atsoisemwa bae isang'ano yenu au unoghelo wenu yamuulanguse kuna yeye kwa kuwapfila iwanu wake na pfamghendelela kuwapfila. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Twobama chila munu mna mwemwe alanguse ukwiyunda kuko mbaka utsighilo, ili achila chambetetsa chitimile. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ng'atubama bae muwe wadebwe, ila muwe ka awala iwatoghole na kududumila, kuya tsawabokela chalaghane Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Laghano lye Imulungu lya kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Imulungu hayekile laghano na Abrahamu, tsakatumila taghwa lyake kwilaha kwaapfila kuduhu imkulu kubita Imulungu, kuna yeye ang'elahile. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Imulungu tsakalonga, “Nitsokubaliki ghendo, nitsokwing'a iwana wengi.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Abrahamu tsakabetetsa kwa ukududumila, kuya kabokela achila chayalongelighwe ne Imulungu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Iwanu hawelaha, welaha kwa yula iyali imkulu kubita wawo, na ukwilaha kolangusa ka ichilongighwe cholongesa, na kwilaha komalitsa ukwihisanya kwose. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Naye Imulungu pfipfo tsakakindilisa chalaghane kwa ukwilaha, kwa kutenda apfo kawalangusa awala yelaghane nawo ka ng'atsoghalusa chayobama. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hana pfinu pfino pfibili ng'apfidaha kughaluka, mna apfo Imulungu ng'odaha bae kulonga ughutsu. Lelo twetwe yatutsumilile hanu tseghamba twoghumighwa ghumoyo kukindilisa ghendo lolelo ilikighwe hambele hetu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Tuna lolelo lino ka nanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nanga; chuma chitito ichihulumsighwa hasi mwe ghamatsi ili imeli ileke kuka</char></note> kwa ughima wetu. Lolelo alyo lima na lina ngupfu, lyakwingila mghati mwe ilipanziya, mbaka hanu haenzeluke, <verse number="20" style="v"/>amwo hayengile Yesu kwaajili yetu, chilongotsi wetu, kawa mtambika mkulu kwa ghamatsuwa ghose ka pfayakalile Melikisedeki.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mtambika Melikisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ayu Melikisedeki tsakakala mndewa ghumji ghwa Salemu, na mtambika we Imulungu iyali kuchanya ghendo. Abrahamu hayang'ali yakuya kulawa mng'ondo ako kwayawakomile iwandewa, Melikisedeki tsaketingana naye, kambaliki, <verse number="2" style="v"/>naye Abrahamu tsakamwing'a kumi limwe lye ipfinu pfose pfayang'ali napfo. Mana ya taghwa lyake “Imndewa wa kutenda ighanoghile,” pfipfila yeye tsakakala “Imndewa wa Salemu,” mana yake “Imndewa wa tindiwalo.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tsakahela aba wala mai, tsakahela lukolo, kuduhu imunu iyomanya yelekighwe tsuwachi wala yafile tsuwachi. Tsakeghala ne Imwana we Imulungu, koghendelela kuwa mtambika ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lelo mlole, imunu ayo pfayakalile mkulu. Hata mbala wetu Abrahamu tsakamwing'a kumi limwe lye ipfinu pfose pfayabokile mng'ondo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Na awala lukolo lwa Lawi iwakalile watambika tsawalaghitsighwa na Ghamalaghitso Imulungu ghamwing'ile Musa, wabokele kumi limwe lye ipfinu kulawa kwe iwanu we Isiraeli, ndughu tsawo, hata ka tsawakala watsukulu wa Abrahamu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Melikisedeki ng'awile bae wa lukolo lwa Walawi, lekeni tsakabokela kumi limwe lye pfinu kulawa kwa Abrahamu, kuya kambaliki yeye iyabokele malaghano. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ng'ailemighwa bae ka imunu iyobaliki ka mkulu kubita ayula iyobalikighwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuya iwatambika iwobokela kumi limwe lye ipfinu wa iwanu iwakufa, lekeni hano kumi limwe lye ipfinu tsalibokelighwa ne imunu iyolongighwa ka mghima ghamatsuwa ghose, ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuya twodaha kulonga, iwanaghe Lawi iwobokela kumi limwe lye ipfinu, kubitila Abrahamu nawo tsawaliha kumi limwe lye ipfinu, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Melikisedeki hayatingane na Abrahamu, Lawi tsayang'ali mlukuli mwa Abrahamu, imbala wake.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu keghala na Melikisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Waisiraeli tsaweng'ighwa ghamalaghitso kwa sang'ano ya ukutambika ya Walawi. Lelo ka ukutambika kwa Walawi kwotimitsa ghose, ebali yabamighwe mtambika yungi iyeghalile ne Melikisedeki, na si Aruni bae? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mana ukutambika kung'aghaluka, ghamalaghitso nagho ghobamighwa ghaghaluke. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Naye Imtwatsa wetu, iyolongighwa mbuli tsino, kolawila mlukolo lungi, na kuduhu imunu wa lukolo alwo iyasang'ane hanu ha kutambikila. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwaapfila twomanya ghendo ka yeye kalawila mlukolo lwa Yuda, na Musa ng'alongile chinu bae kwa lukolo luno kwa mbuli tsa watambika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kuya chinu chino cha mwatsimwatsi ghendo ka mtambika yungi iyeghalile na Melikisedeki kalawila. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yeye ng'atendighwe mtambika kwa ghamalaghitso ghe iwanu, ila kwa ngupfu tsa ughima ulihela utsighilo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholonga, “Ghweghwe kutsakuwa mtambika ghamatsuwa ghose, ka pfakalile Melikisedeki.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lelo laghitso lila lya ghumwande tsalikighwa hambali kwaapfila tsalyahela ingupfu na tsalyahela sang'ano. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mana Ghamalaghitso gheng'ighwe Musa ne Imulungu ng'aghadahile bae kutenda chinu chochose chitimile, lekeni sambi twing'ighwa lolelo linoghile, kubitila lolelo alyo twodaha kumghendela Imulungu habehi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kuya hano Imulungu tsakelaha, ila awala wangi hawatendighwe watambika tsakuduhu ukwilaha. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu tsakawa mtambika kubitila ukwilaha ahala Imulungu hayamlongele,</para>
  <para style="q">“Imtwatsa tsakelaha,</para>
  <para style="q">kuya ng'atsoghalusa achila chobama,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Ghweghwe kwa mtambika ghamatsuwa ghose.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwa ukwilaha kuno, Yesu kawa mwimilitsi wa laghano ilinoghile ghendo kubita lila lya mwanduso.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kuya awala watambika wangi tsawakala wengi kwaapfila tsawang'ali wakufa, apfo ng'awadahile bae kughendelela ne isang'ano yawo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lekeni kwaapfila Yesu ka mghima ghamatsuwa ghose, ukutambika kwake ng'akumala bae. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Apfo yeye kodaha kuwakombola ghendo awala iwomtsila Imulungu kubitila yeye, mana yeye kokala ghamatsuwa ghose yawalombele kwe Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kwaapfila tsaibamighwa tuwe na mtambika mkulu ka yuno iyali mwenzeluka, iyalihela totso lyolyose wala nzambi, yabaghulighwe kutali na wane nzambi, na yenulighwe kubita kulanga. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yeye ng'eghala ne watambika wakulu wangi bae, ng'obamighwa kulapfa nambiko chila litsuwa, tanu kwa nzambi tsake imwenyegho, kuya kwa nzambi tse iwanu wangi. Tsakalapfa inambiko mala lumwe hela kwa iwanu wose baho helapfile imwenyegho. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ghamalaghitso gheng'ighwe Musa ne Imulungu ghowasaghula iwanu yang'awakamilike wawe watambika wakulu, lekeni laghano lye Imulungu ilitendighwe kwa ukwilaha, ilitsile hambele he Ghamalaghitso agho, lyomsaghula Imwana, iyatendighwe yatimilike ghamatsuwa ghose.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu mtambika wetu mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Imbuli ng'ulu kubita ghose ghatulongile, iyo ino, tuna Mtambika mkulu iyakalile lubali lwe kujilo lwe chighoda che undewa che Mkulu ako kulanga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yeye kosang'ana ka mtambika mkulu hanu hala haenzeluke kubita hanu hohose, hane bumbulika lye Imulungu lya kweli, ilitsengighwe ne Imtwatsa, si ne iwanu bae iwatsengile. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Chila mtambika mkulu kosaghulighwa amlapfile Imulungu ghweko ne nambiko, lelo mtambika wetu mkulu kabamighwa yawe na chinu cho ukumlapfila Imulungu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ka ang'awile wa hano muisi, ang'alekile kuwa mtambika mbe, kwaapfila ma kuna watambika iwolapfa ghweko ka pfaghalaghitse Ghamalaghitso gheng'ighwe Musa ne Imulungu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nawo wosang'ana aghala igheghala na ghumfano au sisila lya ighali kulanga. Pfipfo Musa habamile kutsenga bumbulika lila, kalongelighwa ne Imulungu, “Ulole, utsenge ka pfulangusighwe haukalile kuchidunda.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lekeni sambi Yesu keng'ighwa isang'ano ya ukutambika inoghile kubita yawo, ka pfayali mlamlitsi wa laghano ilinoghile kubita laghano lila, kwaapfila lima mne ipfinu pfinoghile ghendo pfalongile Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ka laghano lila ililongole ng'aliwile na totso bae, ng'alibamighwa bae laghano lya keli. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni Imulungu kona matotso kwe iwanu wake, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Imtwatsa kolonga, ghamatsuwa ghakutsa,</para>
  <para style="q">hanitsakwika laghano lya sambi ne iwanu wa Isiraeli ne iwanu wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ng'alitseghala bae ne laghano lyanyikile ne iwabala wawo,</para>
  <para style="q">ghamatsuwa ghala haniwakindile ghamoko na kuwalongotsa walawe mne isi ya Misiri.</para>
  <para style="q">Kwaapfila ng'awakindile laghano lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q">na nene tsaniwalema.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lekeni alino laghano lyanitsotenda ne iwanu wa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q">hambele ha ghamatsuwa agho,</para>
  <para style="q">nitsakwika ghamalaghitso ghangu mne tsimbutsi tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q">nitsoghandika mne mimoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q">Nitsakuwa Imulungu wawo,</para>
  <para style="q">nawo watsakuwa iwanu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu yatsomlangulitsa miyaghe,</para>
  <para style="q">au kumlongela ndughu yake,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mmanye Imtwatsa’</para>
  <para style="q">kwaapfila wose iwanu wakulu ne iwadodo watsonimanya.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nitsowaleghusila matotso ghawo na nzambi tsawo sitsotsipfikitsa keli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kwa kulilonga laghano lya sambi, kalitenda lila lya mwanduso lilale, na chinu chochose ichilala cha habehi kuhupa.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ukutambika muisi na ukutambika kulanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Laghano lya mwanduso likala na malaghitso gha ukutamanila na hanu hakutamanila hatsengighwe ne iwanu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tsahatsengighwa bumbulika lye Imulungu, chiheleto chake cha mwanduso tsachikemighwa Hanu Haenzeluke, amwo tsamkala na hanu ha kwikila pfitasa na imetsa ne pfighate ipfilapfighwe kwe Imulungu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kuchughu mwa lipanziya lya keli tsakukala na chiheleto ichikemighwe Hanu Haenzeluke Ghendo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hamo tsamkala na hanu ha kupfukitsa upfumba ha nzahabu, na sanduku lya laghano ilighubikwe hosehose na nzahabu, mghati mwake tsakukala na chiha che nzahabu ichikalile ne chijo ichikemighwe mana, ng'weku ya Aruni iisanule mitsani na pfibao ipfandikighwe ghamalaghitso. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mchanya mwe sanduku tsakukala na pfinyagho pfibili pfine ghamapamanilo ka chitango cha utunitso we Imulungu, ghamapamanilo ghawo tsaghaghubika hanu hatsileghusighwa nzambi. Lekeni sambi ng'atudaha bae kulonga chinaghanagha mbuli tse pfinu pfino.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pfinu pfino hapfimalile kutendighwa, watambika tsawang'ali wakwingilagha mne chiheleto cha mwanduso na kulapfa nambiko chila litsuwa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lekeni mtambika mkulu yaliheka iyang'ali yakwingila mne chiheleto cha kabili, naye tsakatenda apfo mala imwe iliyeka kwa ghumwaka, tsakengilagha na idamu ya kumlapfila Imulungu kwaajili yake imwenyegho na kwaajili ye nzambi tsawatendile iwanu bila kumanya. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kolangusa chinu chino, inzila ya ukwingila hanu Haenzeluke Ghendo ha kulanga tsang'ana ipfughulighwe bae, kwaapfila chiheleto cha kunze tsaching'ali baho. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Chinu chino cheghala na ghamatsuwa ghano gha sambi, maghweko na nambiko tsolapfighwa lekeni ng'atsidaha bae kutenda imimoyo ye iwanu iwomtamanila Imulungu ileke kuwa na matotso, <verse number="10" style="v"/>kwaapfila ukuja na ukunwa na ukwopfugha lukuli, tsapfikala pfihendo pfe lukuli luliyeka, na ngupfu yake itsomala Imulungu hatsopfitenda pfinu pfose pfiwe pfa sambi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lekeni Kiristu katsa, ka mtambika mkulu wa ighanoghile ighapfikile sambi. Yeye tsakengila mne bumbulika kulu na ilinoghile ghendo, ing'alitsengighwe kwa ghamoko ghe iwanu bae, si bumbulika lya isi ino ilumbighwe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tsakengila hanu Haenzeluke Ghendo mala imwe hela, naye ng'engile na idamu ye mvulati au idamu ye ng'ombe, ila kwa idamu yake imwenyegho, na katughalila ughombotsi wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ka idamu ya mvulati na ng'ombe na lipfu lye ng'ombe iyali mbughuma pfawamitsilighwe iwanu wehile, pfiwatenda iwanu awo wele nguli tsawo, <verse number="14" style="v"/>lelo pfii idamu ya Yesu Kiristu, ambe unogha ghendo? Yeye kwa ingupfu ya Ghumuhe iyokala ghamatsuwa ghose, tsakelapfa imwenyegho yawe nambiko inoghile, iitsotutenda mimoyo yetu yele ghendo kulawa mne ghamatendo ghetu ghehile, ili tumsang'anile Imulungu iyali mghima!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apfo Kiristu iyo mlamlitsi wa laghano lya sambi, ili awala iwakemighwe wabokele laghano lya ukuhala kwa ghamatsuwa ghose. Kwaapfila yeye tsakafa ili yawaghombole iwanu kulawa mne nzambi tsawatendile mne laghano lila lya ghumwande.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwaapfila usiya wotogholighwa, ka ayula yaulongile kafa, <verse number="17" style="v"/>kwaapfila usiya una ingupfu ka imunu yaulongile kafa, usiya wahela ingupfu ka munu yaulongile ka mghima. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Apfo hata laghano lila lya mwanduso ng'alyanduse bae bila idamu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Tanu Musa kawalongela iwanu wose chila laghitso ilili mne Ghamalaghitso ghayeng'ighwe ne Imulungu, kuya kasola idamu ya ndama na mvulati na ghamatsi, na sufi na imitsani ya hisopo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hisopo, mmea wighalile na mpfumbasi</char></note>, tsakachimitsila Chitabu che Ghamalaghitso na kawamitsila iwanu wose. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tsakalonga, “Aino idamu ya laghano lyalaghitse Imulungu mlikinde.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pfipfila Musa tsakamitsila idamu mne bumbulika lila ne ipfinu pfose pfa ukutambikila. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Na mne Ghamalaghitso habehi ipfinu pfose pfotendighwa pfela kwa idamu, na nzambi yoleghusighwa ahala haliyeka haukwitika idamu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pfinu pfino ipfighalile ne ipfinu pfa kulanga tsapfibamighwa kutendighwa pfela kwa nzila ayo. Lekeni ipfinu pfa kulanga pfobama nambiko inoghile ghendo.</para>
  <para style="s">Idamu ya Yesu yoleghusa nzambi tse iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Kiristu ng'engile bae Hanu Haenzeluke hatsengighwe kwa ghamoko ghe iwanu bae, hanu heghalile na hanu henyegho hali kulanga. Tsakengila kulanga kwenyegho, sambi kakwima hambele he Imulungu kwaajili yetu, <verse number="25" style="v"/>wala Kiristu ng'engile kulanga kulapfa lukuli lwake chila ghumwaka ka Mtambika mkulu pfayengile Hanu Haenzeluke Ghendo na idamu yaili si yake bae, <verse number="26" style="v"/>mana ing'awile apfo, Kiristu ang'adununzighwe mala nyingi kulawa isi hailumbighwe. Lekeni sambi matsuwa agha ighali habehi kutsigha, yeye kalawila mala lumwe hela kuleghusa nzambi kwa nambiko ya lukuli lwake imwenyegho. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ka imunu pfayakufa mala lumwe hela, kuya kohighighwa ne Imulungu, <verse number="28" style="v"/>pfipfo Kiristu naye tsakelapfa nambiko mala lumwe hela ili yawaleghusile nzambi iwanu wengi. Hayatsolawila lwakeli, ng'oitsila bae inzambi, ila kakutsa kuwakombola awala iwomlolela.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Ghamalaghitso gheng'ighwe Musa ne Imulungu gheghala na sisila lya ipfinu pfinoghile ipfikutsa, pfelinga na apfila pfa kweli, nambiko tsila tsa Ghamalaghitso gheng'ighwe Musa ne Imulungu itsilapfighwe kwa kuyililayilila chila ghumwaka ng'atsidaha bae kuwatenda wanoghe awala iwomtamanila Imulungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ka iwanu wala iwomtamanila Imulungu wang'atendighwe wela ghendo kulawa mne nzambi tsawo, wang'alekile kwibona keli ka wana nzambi, na nambiko tsila tsawolapfa tsose tsing'amalile. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lekeni nambiko tsila tsitendeka chila ghumwaka kuwakumbusa iwanu nzambi tsawo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwaapfila idamu ye mvulati na ng'ombe ng'aidaha bae kuleghusa nzambi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Apfo Kiristu hayang'ali yakutsa muisi, tsakamlongela Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ng'ubamile nambiko wala sadaka,</para>
  <para style="q">lekeni tsakuniyandalila lukuli. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa</para>
  <para style="q">au tsa kuleghusa nzambi ng'atsikunoghele bae.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuya tsanilonga, ‘Nabaha ghwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q">kutenda aghala ghubama</para>
  <para style="q">ka pfanyandikilighwe mne Chitabu cha Ghamalaghitso gheng'ighwe Musa ne Imulungu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tanu tsakalonga, “Ng'ubamile bae wala ng'unoghelesighwe na tsinambiko na sadaka, nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa na tsa kuleghusa nzambi.” Tsakalonga apfo hata ka nambiko tsila tsose tsatsilapfighwa ka Ghamalaghitso pfaghabamile. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kuya kalonga, “Nene nabaha, ghwe Imulungu, kutenda aghala ghubama.” Apfo Imulungu keka hambali nambiko tsa ghumwande, keka nambiko ingi imwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Yesu Kiristu tsakamalitsa ghayobama Imulungu, twetwe twodeghetesighwa nzambi tsetu kwa inambiko ya lukuli lwake mwenyegho yalulapfile mala lumwe hela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Chila mtambika kosang'ana chila litsuwa, kolapfa nambiko tsitsila mala nyingi, nambiko ing'atsidaha mbe kuleghusa nzambi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lekeni Kiristu kalapfa nambiko imwe kwaajili ya kuleghusa nzambi, nambiko inoghile ghamatsuwa ghose, kuya kakala lubali lwe kujilo lwe Imulungu, <verse number="13" style="v"/>kobeta wehile wake wekighwe hasi ha ghamaghulu ghake. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwaapfila kwa nambiko imwe tsakawatenda awala iwodeghetesighwa wanoghe ghamatsuwa ghose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka pfipfila kotulangusa ukalangama wa mbuli ayo. Tanu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Imtwatsa kolonga, “Alino laghano lyanitsolaghana nawo</para>
  <para style="q">hambele ha ghamatsuwa agho,</para>
  <para style="q">nitsakwika ghamalaghitso ghangu mne mimoyo yawo</para>
  <para style="q">na kughandika mne tsimbutsi tsawo.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuya kalonga, “Sitsotsipfikitsa keli nzambi tsawo, na ghehile ghawatendile.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lelo aghano ghang'aleghusighwa, kuduhu keli kulapfa nambiko ya kuleghusa nzambi.</para>
  <para style="s">Tumsoghelele Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lelo ndughu tsangu, kwa idamu ya Yesu twodaha ghendo kwingila Hanu Haenzeluke Ghendo bila kupfuka. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yeye tsakatupfughulila inzila ya sambi, inzila itulongotsa mne ughima kubitila lipanziya lila kwa kulapfa lukuli lwake. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lelo tuna mtambika wetu mkulu ghendo iyolongotsa mne ing'anda ye Imulungu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Apfo tumsoghelele Imulungu kwa imimoyo ya kweli na kwa ukutoghola bila kupfuka, aku mimoyo yetu itotsile yele, tuleke ghehile na ng'uli tsetu tsiopfughighwe kwa ghamatsi ghelile. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Tulikinde ghendo lolelo lyetu lyatulitoghola na kulilonga, kwaapfila Imulungu yekile laghano lyake kotogholighwa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Twilolese twetwe kwa twetwe, twighume ghumoyo, twinoghele na kutenda ghanoghile. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kuya tuleke kuleka kwitingana hamwe, ka wamwenga pfawatendagha, ila twighume ghumoyo na tughendelele kutenda apfo, ghendoghendo ka pfamkona litsuwa lye Mtwatsa lya habehi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kwaapfila tung'aghendelela kutenda nzambi ghiladi aku twomanya ukweli, kuduhu nambiko iidaha kulapfighwa keli kwaajili ya kuleghusa nzambi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lekeni ichisighala, kuko ukubeta kwa kupfuka kuhighighwa ne Imulungu kwa ghumoto ighulambila ighutsowahinya wose iwombela. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Imunu yaghalemile Ghamalaghitso gheng'ighwe Musa ne Imulungu, tsakakomighwa bila libatsi ka kuna wakalangama weli au wadatu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lelo mkonatse, kobamighwa yahighighwetse imunu iyambetsile Imwana we Imulungu na kuyona si chinu bae idamu ye laghano lye Imulungu iimdeghetetse, imunu iyomligha Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu? <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwaapfila twomanya chayalongile Imulungu, “Nene nitsowoyitsila chawamtendeleni, nene nitsowalia wawo,” kuya kalonga, “Imtwatsa katsowahigha iwanu wake.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kughwila mna ghamoko ghe Imulungu iyali mghima, chinu cha kupfuka ghendo!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lekeni kumbukani ghamatsuwa gha mwanduso hala hamghubulilighwe ukweli we Imulungu. Hata ka tsamdununzika ghendo, mwemwe tsamdudumila. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa ghangi tsamlighighwa na kutendelighwa ghehile hambele he iwanu, ghamatsuwa ghangi tsamtoghola kuwa hamwe na awala iwadununzike pfipfo. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Tsamuwonela libatsi wohighwa, na hambokighwe pfinu pfenu tsamtoghola kwa ukudeng'elela, kwaapfila tsammanya ka mna chinu chinoghile kubita apfo na chokala ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lelo mleke kwaghitsa lolelo lyenu, kwaapfila lina ghweko kulu ghendo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mdudumile ili mtende ghobama Imulungu na kubokela achila chawalongele. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ka Ghamaandiko pfagholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ing'ali chidogho,</para>
  <para style="q">ayo iyakutsa katsakutsa,</para>
  <para style="q">ng'atsokawa bae.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Iwanu wangu iwotenda ighoninogheletsa watsotoghola na kukala waghima,</para>
  <para style="q">lekeni wang'apfukapfuka,</para>
  <para style="q">sinogheletsighwa nawo bae.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lekeni twetwe si iwanu wa ukupfukapfuka bae na ukuhinyighwa, ila twetwe twotoghola na twokombolighwa.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ukumtoghola Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ukumtoghola Imulungu kuko kumanya kwa hakika aghala ghatubeta, na kutoghola ghendo aghala yang'aghakoneka bae. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwa ukutoghola kwawo, iwabala wetu tsawatogholighwa ne Imulungu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu twetwe twomanya ka isi yose tsailumbighwa kwa laghitso lya Imulungu, ipfinu ipfikoneka pfilumbighwa kulawa mne pfinu ing'apfikoneka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu Abeli tsakamlapfila Imulungu nambiko inoghile kubita ya Kaini. Kwa kutoghola kwake, kamnoghelesa Imulungu ahala haitoghole nambiko yake. Hata ka Abeli tsakafa, aghala ghatendile ghang'ali ghotulangulitsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu Enoki tsakasolighwa kulanga, apfo ng'afile bae. Ng'oneke keli kwaapfila Imulungu tsakamsola. Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholonga hala ng'ana yasolighwe, tsakatogholighwa ka imunu iyamnoghelese Imulungu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu iyodaha kumnoghelesa Imulungu bila kumtoghola, kwaapfila imunu wowose iyomghendela Imulungu kobamighwa atoghole ka Imulungu kabaho, nae kowaghweka awala iwombama kwa ukwiyunda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu Nuhu tsakalongelighwa ne Imulungu aghala ighakutsa hambele, aghala ng'ana ghoneke bae. Kwa pfila pfamuhulikitse Imulungu, katsenga safina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">safina; yeghala ne imeli ing'ulu</char></note>, amwo yeye na iwanu we kaye yake tsawakombolighwa. Kwa kutoghola kwake kalangusa iwanu we isi yose weha, na Nuhu kawa muhatsi wa haki iikutsa kwa kutoghola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu Abrahamu hakemighwe aghende mne isi iyalongile Imulungu katsomwing'a, koka mne isi yake kuya ng'amanyile ang'ali yoghenda kwani. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu, Abrahamu tsakakala muhenza mne isi yelaghane ne Imulungu. Tsakakala mne pfibumbulika na Isaka na Yakobu, iwabokele ghaghala ghalaghane Imulungu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Abrahamu tsayang'ali yobeta ghumji ghune ghumsingi, ghumji ighupfikitsighwe na kutsengighwa ne Imulungu mwenyegho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu Abrahamu tsakawa aba hata ka tsakalala ng'ani, na Sara tsaang'ali ng'akweleka bae. Abrahamu tsakamtoghola Imulungu ka katsotimitsa laghano lyake. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apfo kubitila imunu yumwe Abrahamu iyakalile ka kafa, tsawelekighwa iwanu wengi ing'awodahika bae kupetighwa, ka tsinondo tsa kulanga na msanga ghwa kumwani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Iwanu wano wose tsawafa aku womtoghola Imulungu. Ng'awabokele bae aghala ghayalaghane Imulungu, ila tsawaghona kwa kutali, tsawatoghola ka wawo tsawahenza na wabita nzila muisi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Iwanu awala iwolonga apfo, wakoneka ka woibama isi yawo iwenyegho. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wang'aikumbuke isi ila yawalawile, wang'adahile kubwela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lekeni sambi woibama isi inoghile ghendo, isi ya kulanga. Apfo Imulungu ng'akona chinyala bae kukemighwa Imulungu wawo, kwaapfila kawatendela ghumji.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu Abrahamu tsakatoghola kumlapfa nambiko Isaka imwanaghe nyalimwe hala hayaghetsighwe, tsakatenda apfo hata ka Isaka tsakakala imwana wa laghano lye Imulungu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Imulungu tsakamlongela, “Kubitila Isaka kutsopata watsukulu wanikulongele.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Abrahamu tsakatoghola Imulungu kodaha kuwatsilihula iwanu iwafile, kwa kulonga apfo Abrahamu tsakambokela keli Isaka kulawa kwe iwanu iwafile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu Isaka kawabaliki Yakobu na Esau, kwa aghala ighakutsa hambele.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu Yakobu hayang'ali habehi kufa kawabaliki iwana wose wa Yosefu, kamtamanila Imulungu aku kaghamila ng'weku yake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu Yosefu hayang'ali habehi kufa, tsakalonga mbuli tsa Waisiraeli kulawa Misiri, kawalaghitsa waitendetse imipate yake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu welesi wa Musa tsawampfisa Musa kwa miyetsi midatu kulawa hayoneke. Tsawamwona kakala imwana yanoghile, ng'awapfukile bae ghamalaghitso gha imndewa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu, Musa hakulile kalema kukemighwa imwana wa neghe Farao mndewa wa misiri. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Tsakasaghula kudununzika ne iwanu we Imulungu kubita kudeng'elela uhondo wa nzambi kwa ghamatsuwa chidogho. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Tsakona ukumdununzikila Kiristu Mkombotsi kunogha ghendo kubita tsimali tsa Misiri kwaapfila tsayang'ali yololela ghweko lyake lya hambele.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu Musa tsakalawa Misiri bila kupfuka maya ye mndewa. Kwaapfila tsakamlolela ghendo Imulungu yang'akoneka bae. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu tsakatenda chihungo cha Pasaka na kulaghitsa idamu imitsighwe mne mibani, malaika wa lifwa aleke kuwakoma iwana chaudele wa Waisraeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu Waisraeli tsawaloka ibahali ya Shamu ka mne isi isakale, lekeni Wamisiri hawabamile kuloka tsawafa mne ghamatsi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu imibanda ya ghumji ghwa Yeriko ighwa hasi Waisraeli hawaitsunguluke kwa ghamatsuwa saba. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu Rahabu, pinga chiweghe ng'akomighwe bae na awala yang'awamuhulikitse Imulungu, kwaapfila tsakawabokela pfinoghile wapelembi wa Waisraeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lelo nonge choni keli? Nahela nyafwasi ya kulonga mbuli tsa Gidioni na tsa Balaki na tsa Samsoni na tsa Yefita na tsa Daudi na tsa Samweli na tsa manabii. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Awo kwa kumtoghola Imulungu tsawawahuma iwandewa. Tsawahigha ka pfaimnogheletsa Imulungu na wabokela chayalaghane Imulungu. Tsawadiwa imilomo ye simba. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Tsawatsima milambi ya ghumoto, tsawahoneka kukomighwa kwa imimaghe. Hawang'ali wahela tsingupfu, waghumighwa tsingupfu, tsawakala ne ngupfu mng'ondo, wawawinga asikali wahenza. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kwa kumtoghola Imulungu iwapinga wamwenga tsawoyitsighwa iwanu wawo iwafile iwatsilihulighwe. Wangi wawo tsawadununzika mbaka wafa, waleka kutoghola kulekelighwa ili watsilihuke na kwingila ughima unoghile. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wangi tsawabetsighwa na kutowighwa mbalati, na wamwenga tsawohighwa na kwasighwa mchifungo. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Tsawafa kwa kutowighwa na ghamabwe, tsawaghanighwa kwa msumeno pfihande pfili, wakomighwa kwa imimaghe, tsawanga kuno na kuno aku wapfala ngotsi tse iwang'olo ne iwamene. Tsawakala wahingwa, wadununzighwa na watendelighwa ghehile. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Tsang'aibamighwe bae iwanu we isi yose ino wakale ne iwanu ka awo. Tsawang'ali woyungayunga kunyika na mpfidunda, tsawakala mne tsimango na mne mipondo muisi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Iwanu wano wose watogholighwa ka wahuma kwa ukutoghola kwawo. Hata apfo ng'awabokele bae aghala ghalongile Imulungu, <verse number="40" style="v"/>kwaapfila Imulungu tsakatutendela twetwe chinu chinoghile ghendo kubita chawabokele wawo, ili wawo waleke kukamilika bila twetwe.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imulungu kowahigha iwanaghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Apfo ka pfatuli ne kingili kulu lye iwakalangama hambele hetu, tuleke chila mtsigho ghwatwinagho na nzambi iitunanahila, na mna mdawalo ghwa kutsuma ighwikighwe hambele hetu tutsume kwa kududumila. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tumtsodelele tsinenge Yesu iyanduse ukutoghola kwetu na iyatsoitimitsa. Kwaajili ye ndeng'elelo ikighwe hambele hake tsakaududumila msalaba, tsakona ichinyala si chinu bae, naye kokala ghumoko ghwa kujilo ghwe chighoda che undewa che Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mumkumbuke Yesu, pfadununzike na iwanu wane nzambi pfawamwihile. Lelo mleke kwipfa na kutenyuka ghumoyo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mne ukwihisanya kwenu na nzambi ng'ana mwihisanye mbaka mlapfe idamu yenu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pfii msemwa imbuli ila ya kughuma ghumoyo ahala Imulungu hayomkemani mwemwe iwanaghe?</para>
  <para style="q">Mwanangu uleke kubetsa Imtwatsa hayokukanya,</para>
  <para style="q">kuya hayokukembela uleke kutenyuka ghumoyo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Imtwatsa komuhigha chila imunu iyomnoghela,</para>
  <para style="q">na komkanya chila imwana iyotogholighwa naye.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mdudumile ahala hamkanyighwa, Imulungu kowatendelani ka iwanaghe. Apfi imwana wachi yang'okanyighwa na aba wake? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ka ng'amkanyighwa ka pfawokanyighwa iwanaghe wose, mwemwe si iwanaghe ghendo, ila wana halamu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kubita agho, twetwe tsatukala na aba tsetu iwatweleke iwatukanyile, na twetwe tsatuwatoghola kwa chinu acho chawatendile, lelo ambe pfinogha ng'ani tung'amtegheletsa ghendo Aba wetu wa kulanga, ili twing'ighwe ughima. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Aba tsetu iwatweleke tsawatukanya kwa matsuwa madodo ka pfawonile iwenyegho pfinogha, ila Imulungu kotukanya kwa ukutwapfila twetwe, ili tuwe wahenzeluka wake. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lekeni sambi ukukanyighwa si chinu cha kudeng'elesa bae, ila chinu ichighala usungu, lekeni hambele ukukanyighwa kutsoghala ghamapfuno gha tindiwalo na ukukala kwa kumnoghelesa Imulungu kwa awala iwakanyighwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Malaghitso na makanyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lelo mghaghume ngupfu ghamoko ghenu ighaleghele, kuya mgholose ghamaghoti ghenu ighaleghele. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mghendelele kubita mne inzila iigholoke, ili achila ichiholole chileke kugholojoka ila chihonetsighwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mwiyunde ghendo kukala kwa tindiwalo ne iwanu wose na kukala kwa uhenzeluka, kwaapfila kuduhu imunu iyatsomwona Imtwatsa ka ng'enzeluke bae. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mwalangitse ghendo, imunu wowose aleke kuhungukiwa na uluso we Imulungu, aleke kuwa ka sina lya usungu ilitula na kuwaghalila maghayo iwanu wengi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuleke kuwa na mghoni wala imunu yang'ompfuka Imulungu bae, ka Esau iyautsile uhatsi wake wa kuwa chaudele kwa chijo chimwe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwaapfila mwomanya hata hambele habamile kuipata keli ibalaka ila, tsakalemighwa kwaapfila ng'adahile bae kughalusa chayatendile, hata ka tsakaibama ghendo kwa masotsi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mwemwe ng'ampfikile bae hane chidunda Sinai ka iwanu wa Isiraeli pfawapfikile, chidunda ichidaha kukindighwa, aku chakwaka ghumoto, hane liwingu titu, ichisi na libeho kulu, <verse number="19" style="v"/>na litsi lya malati na litsi ililonga mbuli. Iwanu wala iwahulike litsi alyo, tsawalomba kwa ukudedetsa waleke kuhulika keli, <verse number="20" style="v"/>kwaapfila ng'awadahile bae kulibokela laghitso ililongighwe, “Hata mnyama ang'achidonza chidunda acho, atowighwe ghamabwe mbaka afe.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Agho ghose ghawatenda wapfuke sideke, mbaka Musa kalonga, “Nodedema na ukupfuka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lekeni mwemwe mchipfikila chidunda Sayuni, hane ghumji ghwe Imulungu iyali mghima, Yerusalemu ya kulanga, hamwe ne wamalaika wengi yang'awopeteka. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mwemwe mtsa mne mtingano we chihungo che iwanu we Imulungu, iwokemighwa welekighwa wa mwanduso we Imulungu, iwandikighwe mataghwa ghawo kulanga. Mtsa kwe Imulungu, yowahigha iwanu wose na muhe tse iwanu iwomnoghelesa Imulungu iwakamilike. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mwemwe mtsa kwa Yesu, mlamlitsi wa laghano lya sambi na idamu yake ighumitsighwe yolonga ghanoghile kubita idamu ya Abeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mwalangitse, mleke kulema kumuhulikitsa yeye iyolonga namwe. Kwaapfila ka ng'awahoneke bae awala iwamlemile yeye iyawakanyile hano muisi, twetwe twodahatse kuhona tung'amlema iyolonga na twetwe kulawa kulanga! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Litsi lyake tsalihighisa isi ghamatsuwa ghala, lekeni sambi kalaghana, kalonga, “Nitsoihighisa keli mala lumwe si isi iliheka bae, ila na kulanga pfipfila.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Imbuli ayo “mala lumwe keli” yolangusa ghendo ka ipfinu ipfilumbighwe pfitsohighisighwa na kulapfighwa, ili pfisighale apfila ing'apfidaha kuhighisighwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lelo kwaapfila tubokela undewa ing'audaha kuhighisighwa bae, mleke tumlongele Imulungu mighede, tumtamanile kwa kumnoghelesa na kwa kumtegheletsa na kwa kupfuka, <verse number="29" style="v"/>kwaapfila Imulungu wetu ka ghumoto ighuhinya ghendo.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kumtunya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mghendelele kwinoghela chindughu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mleke kwisemwa kuwabokela iwahenza mmakaye mwenu, kwaapfila kwa kutenda apfo iwanu wangi tsawawabokela wamalaika aku ng'awamanyile bae. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mleke kuwasemwa awala iwali mchifungo ka mwemwe mwohighwa hamwe nawo. Muwakumbuke awala iwodununzika ka namwe mwodununzika nawo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Iwanu iwekwelile wehulikitse, mmale au mwehe yaleke kuwasa ne imunu yungi. Imulungu katsowahigha waghoni na watsinzi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mleke kunoghela ng'ani tsisendi, mdeng'elele na ipfinu pfamwinapfo. Kwaapfila Imulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Sitsokuleka mbe,</para>
  <para style="q">sitsokwasa mbe.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Apfo twodaha kulonga bila kupfuka</para>
  <para style="q">Imtwatsa iyo iyonyapfila,</para>
  <para style="q">Sitsopfuka bae.</para>
  <para style="q">Imunu katsonenda choni?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Muwakumbuke awala iwang'ali womlongotsani, iwamlongeleni imbuli ye Imulungu. Mkumbuke pfawakalile na pfawafile, mwighale nawo pfawamtoghole Imulungu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu Kiristu ka yuyula, ligholo, leloli na ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mleke kusolighwa ne ghamalangulitso ghangi, pfinogha mimoyo yetu ighelighwe ngupfu kwa uluso we Imulungu, wala si kwa malaghitso ghe ipfijo bae, kwaapfila malaghitso agho ng'aghawapfile bae awala iwaghawinzile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Twetwe tuna hanu ha kutambikila, amo awala iwosang'ana mne bumbulika lya ukutamanila lya Wayahudi waghomighwa ukuja inambiko yake yoyose. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mtambika mkulu koghala idamu ye iwanyama Hanu Haenzeluke Ghendo, koghulapfa ka inambiko ya kuleghusa nzambi, lekeni ng'uli tse iwanyama tsolakatsighwa kunze mwe kambi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apfo Yesu naye ili yawadeghetese iwanu kwa idamu yake imwenyegho, kadununzika na kufa kunze kwe ghumji. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lelo leka tumghendele kunze kwe kambi tukalighighwe ka yeye pfalighighwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwaapfila hano muisi twahela ghumji ighukala ila twokalitsa ghumji ighukutsa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lelo kubitila Yesu tumlapfile Imulungu nambiko yo ukumtunya ghamatsuwa ghose, mbuli atso tsa utunitso, tsitso sadaka tsetu hala hatulonga Yesu ka Mtwatsa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mleke kwisemwa kwitendela ghanoghile na kwiyapfa, kwaapfila nambiko ka atso, tsitso itsimnogheletsa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Muwategheletse awala iwomlongotsani na kuwinza malaghitso ghawo. Wawo wololesa muhe tsenu, kwaapfila watsomlongela Imulungu pfawamsang'anile. Mng'awategheletsa watsotenda sang'ano yawo aku wodeng'elela, ka ng'amuwategheletsa watsosang'ana kwa kusing'inika, na chinu acho ng'achitsomwapfilani bae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mtulombele. Twotoghola ghendo ka mimoyo yetu ng'aitulongela bae tutotsa, mana twobama kutenda ghanoghile mne pfinu pfose. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nowalomba ghendo mnilombele Imulungu ambuyitse himahima kuna mwemwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Malombi gha ukumalitsila na ndamso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lelo, Imulungu wa tindiwalo iyamtsilihule Imtwatsa wetu Yesu, imdimi mkulu we iwang'olo kwa idamu iilangusa laghano lya kweli lya ghamatsuwa ghose, <verse number="21" style="v"/>awatende mwemwe mkomale mne chila chinu chinoghile chamtenda, mdahe kughatenda ghayobama, na kwa kubitila Kiristu yatende aghala ighamnogheletsa imwenyegho mghati mwetu. Utunitso uwe kuna Yesu Kiristu ghamatsuwa ghose! Ona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ndughu tsangu nowalomba ghendo, muubokele usenga uno wa kughuma ghumoyo kwa kududumila, aino ibaluwa ndodo hela yanimwandikileni. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nobama mmanye ka ndughu yetu Timoteo kalekelelighwa kulawa mchifungo, ang'atsa sambi nitsakutsa naye kumwonani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Walamseni wose iwomlongotsani na iwanu wose we Imulungu. Wandughu wa isi ya Italiya womlamsani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Uluso we Imulungu ukale namwe mwose.</para>
</usx>
